Wait, did your sister know we were coming?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:41.650
No way.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.880
My sister's terrible at cooking.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:45.520
She probably made a mistake and bought too much.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.430
Hm, it's quiet good.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.550
Let's see the photoalbum.

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:57.230
This is a bath photo of Aki when he was two.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.550
H-He is so pretty!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.900
On this one he is 4 years old.

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:05.050
Heh, he's sleeping!

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.480
On this—7 years old.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:11.370
Wow, he's already in the elementary school!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:15.240
On this—10 years old

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.630
Wait a sec!

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:18.510
Why are you have nothing but my bath photos!?

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:21.550
One this photo he is 11 old.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:25.770
Wait… why are you silent?

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.940
And this one from yesterday's bath!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.000
Whoa, when you took it!?

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.930
Don't look. Don't look, please!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.180
Don't look at this embarrasing photo!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.940
Looks amazing.

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:43.360
You made paella?

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:46.790
Huh? Didn't you buy the ingredients for it?

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.780
It looks really good, Aki.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:53.120
You really could cook, Yoshii...

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:56.970
They saw it! They saw it!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.990
He's always so boisterous.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.660
Minus ten.

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.560
It's your fault! You always bully me!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.430
You hate me, right?

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.920
No, I love you.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.480
As a woman.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.150
My life is over!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:18.210
There's an ancient Japanese saying:

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.550
The dumber the kid, the cuter he is.

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:22.530
Give up, bro.

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:25.540
No one in this world can love you more than her.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.780
That means I'm the dumbest person she knows!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:32.640
I think Aki's the dumbest person in the world too!

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:37.210
Me too! I believe Yoshii is the dumbest person in the entire world!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:40.210
Stop! Don't pour salt on my wounds!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.000
He really is dumb.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.430
No!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:47.600
Okay, now that we're done eating, let's start studying.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.490
If you guys don't mind, I'll help out.

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:52.260
Will you really?

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:56.310
I've recieved a teaching degree from the university on the side.

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:57.580
I think I'll be able to help.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:58.810
On the side?

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.590
Boston in America.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:03.830
Wait... Harvard!?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.920
I see... That's a bit cliche.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.490
What is that supposed to mean?!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:12.560
Here, these are study guides.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.970
I found six under the bed.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.690
My top secrets!

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:20.110
That will be a 60 point deduction.

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.300
Ten points for one?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.500
No, because you have no brother-sister incest porn.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.980
You're kidding me!

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:31.280
Take these study guides.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.870
No! They'll discover my fetishes!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:42.220
It seems like Aki has an absurd interest in big breasted woman with ponytails.

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:48.170
All right, let's start studying.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.850
Why are you putting your hair up, Mizuki!?

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.140
I thought it'd get in the way...

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:55.080
Just tie it into a bun!

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.950
Minami, stop it...

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.580
Why? Your hair won't get in the way like that, right?

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.540
Minus 100 points.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:05.930
Why?

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:09.260
You'll understand when you grow up.

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.990
What's up, Voyeur?

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.680
Where are the other 1994?

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.630
You took me seriously, huh?

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:23.630
Good morning, Yoshii.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:24.850
Morning, Aki.
Good morning, Yoshii.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:24.860
Morning, Aki.

00:18:26.490 --> 00:18:27.700
Morning.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.940
Himeji, you changed your hairstye?

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.220
Yeah, I wanted a different mood.

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:35.910
Minami, you had a boob job?

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.370
No! I woke up and it was like that!

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:39.520
Seriously?

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:41.950
I'm still going through puberty... it's natural!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:47.510
I will not let you defile the sacred secondary sex characteristics.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.250
I had fun yesterday.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:55.190
We learned a lot as well.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.900
I don't know if I'll be able to keep living on my own, though...

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.940
Why can't she just go back to America?

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:02.640
She's your family, you know.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.100
You've got a great sister.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.090
Not at all.

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:08.700
I mean, she goes from deducting
points to trying to make out with me...

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.020
She loves bullying me.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.780
That's not true.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.500
Your sister loves you very much.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.310
You're saying she thinks I'm dumb?!

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:24.720
Your sister cares a great deal about you and how you're living.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:31.360
That means you're really important to her.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.660
Really?

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.250
What should I make tonight?

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:45.810
Well, she finally came back to Japan, so I guess Japanese food is appropriate...

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.040
I'm home.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:51.070
Oh, welcome back, Aki.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.810
I'll go buy ingredients for dinner.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.320
Dinner?

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:57.350
Hang on, Aki.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:59.130
What's up, sis?

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.430
Midterms are nearly here.

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.920
Do you really have time to cook?

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:07.130
Well, not really.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.910
But you're back from America-

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:11.580
I told you, that's putting the carriage before the horse.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.440
I came here to see how you were living,

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:19.380
but you're wasting time on me. That's no good.

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:23.350
If you don't make the cut, you'll blame me for it, and then where will we be?

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:26.750
That's why you don't need to cook for me.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:29.540
All you need to do is study hard.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:30.890
Just leave the cooking to-

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:31.990
What the hell?

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:36.440
The only thing you care about is that grade I get on my report card.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:37.710
Have it your way, then!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:38.990
I'm going to study.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:50.890
I hate her...

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.390
That's why I'm going to score high and shut her up.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.490
Good morning, Yoshii.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.420
Morning, Aki.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:07.160
Don't talk to me or I'm going to forget it all.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:09.150
I see...

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:11.300
Okay, I'll leave you alone to study.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:15.400
All right, get ready.

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:16.180
Begin!

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:19.890
Answer the following questions:

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:20.530
Let's do this!

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:27.350
Question one: In 334BC, the last king of the Achaemenid Empire was Alexander the Great...!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:27.740
Next!

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:31.880
He must be testing right now.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.510
I shall begin as well.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:41.170
All right, I've answered all I can.

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.880
I'll check my answers in the time left.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.740
Pens down.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.980
Pass up your answer sheets.

