...Really, Alexander the Great.

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:11.440
You put the answer to question #1 in the name field,

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:13.670
so all your answers were shifted up one.

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:16.740
Please call me by my real name!

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:18.390
All right, Darius the Third.

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:21.410
Please stop making fun of me!

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:25.670
If I had written the answers
correctly, I would have done well!

00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:30.250
Do you think you can use that excuse if you make the same mistake in the placement exam?

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:33.390
I put in a lot of effort...

00:22:33.630 --> 00:22:38.070
I told you already - effort is just a means to an end.

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:39.900
Okay.

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:46.930
She's so strict.

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:01.070
Man, it's messy...

