00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.720
<i>Effort is nothing but a means to an end.</i>

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:29.640
<i>...being proud of the fact that you tried is just putting the carriage before the horse.</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:35.110
I really am an idiot.

00:23:57.090 --> 00:24:04.360
I knew it. My first kiss tasted like strawberry milk

